  "description": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"43\"><strong><br>Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra 1TB Titanium Black</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"105\"> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"45\" data-end=\"105\">In nieuwstaat, geleverd met doos en USB-kabel.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\"> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">📱 Model: Samsung Galaxy S25 Ultra – Titanium Black</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">💾 Opslag: 1TB</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">🖥️ Display: 6.9 inch Dynamic AMOLED 2X-display met QHD+ resolutie en 120Hz refresh rate</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">⚙️ Specificaties: Snapdragon 8 Elite for Galaxy, Android-besturingssysteem, Galaxy AI-functies</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">📸 Camera: Geavanceerd camerasysteem met ultra-wide, telelens en hoge resolutie hoofdcamera + frontcamera</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">📶 Connectiviteit: 5G, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, NFC, USB-C</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">✏️ Extra: Ingebouwde S Pen ondersteuning</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">🔋 Batterij: Batterij in uitstekende conditie – slechts 2 laadcycli</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">📦 Accessoires: Doos + USB-kabel</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"107\" data-end=\"700\">📦 Garantie: t/m 15-09-2027</p>",
